# Git hygiene across workspace members (`/iflow-workspace-git`)

`/iflow-workspace-git` (chat: `iflow git`) runs **git status-shaped
hygiene** on every scaffolded workspace member. It is **not**
`/iflow-status` (issue-flow lifecycle / GitHub issues).

This is an **off-path** command — `/iflow` never auto-runs it.

{% include "skills/_model_directive.md.j2" %}

{% include "skills/_resolve_project_root.md.j2" %}

## Input

- **(nothing)** or **`status`** — read-only snapshot (branch, dirty paths,
  ahead/behind). No fetch.
- **`fetch`** — `git fetch --prune` on every unlocked member, then the
  same snapshot. Continue-on-fail.

## Steps

> **CLI fast path.** `issue-flow workspace git status [--json]` and
> `issue-flow workspace git fetch [--json]`. Bare `issue-flow workspace git`
> is status. Walks up for `issueflow-workspace.toml`.

